From: Light Shield Mod
Date: 2026-05-23
Subject: [PATCH] Add Light Shield enhancement to Ship of Harkinian

This patch adds a new "Light Shield" enhancement that:
- Gives the player a shield at game start (acts as the Light Shield)
- Makes the shield glow with warm golden light when equipped at night
- Adds a toggle in the Equipment > Gameplay enhancements menu
- Handles room transitions and scene changes properly

